.Dd November 7, 2026
.Dt LSKQ 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm lskq
.Nd list kqueues and their events
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl ver
.Fl a | Fl p Ar pid | Ar pid
.Nm
.Fl h
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
lists the kqueues of a process and the events registered on them.
Name the process with
.Fl p
or a bare
.Ar pid ,
or give
.Fl a .
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl a
List every process.
.It Fl p Ar pid
List this process.
.It Fl e
Leave out empty kqueues.
.It Fl r
Print raw values.
.It Fl v
Print more detail.
.It Fl h
Print a guide to the output.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr kqueue 2
